 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Fun for a kid that age is simple. An amusement park, a zoo, or a farm park are all great. What does he like more, rides or animals? It can be if you book late. Book a few weeks ahead and you' often find much cheaper prices. Then skip the fried food and go for the bread rolls and fruit in the food stalls. Most kids will eat anything there. Perfect. Add on ticket for fast track so he doesn't have to wait in long lines.",
